---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Musique collaborative"
  description="Un projet musical participatif pour créer des morceaux avec des musiciens du monde entier."
>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-4">
      <div class="absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-blue-500/5 blur-3xl"></div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div
            class="inline-flex overflow-hidden rounded-md border gh-border text-xs font-medium"
            role="group"
            aria-label="Language"
          >
            <button
              type="button"
              data-lang="fr"
              class="lang-button px-3 py-1.5 gh-text"
              aria-pressed="true"
            >
              FR
            </button>
            <button
              type="button"
              data-lang="en"
              class="lang-button px-3 py-1.5 gh-text-muted"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              EN
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-content="fr">
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest gh-text-muted">
            Un projet musical participatif
          </p>

          <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight gh-text sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
            Je commence un morceau.<br />
            <span class="gh-text-muted">Vous lui donnez une nouvelle vie.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-6 max-w-none text-lg leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
            Je crée des morceaux à la maison et je partage leurs pistes séparées. Des musiciens
            peuvent alors ajouter leur propre partie, où qu'ils soient dans le monde.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <p class="text-base font-medium gh-text">
              Une chanson. Plusieurs musiciens. Une création collective.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm gh-text-muted">
            Pas de compétition. Pas besoin d'être professionnel. Juste de la musique.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest gh-text-muted">
            A collaborative music project
          </p>

          <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight gh-text sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
            I start a song.<br />
            <span class="gh-text-muted">You give it a new life.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-6 max-w-none text-lg leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
            I create songs at home and share their individual tracks. Musicians can then add their
            own part, wherever they are in the world.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <p class="text-base font-medium gh-text">
              One song. Many musicians. One collective creation.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm gh-text-muted">
            No competition. No need to be a professional. Just music.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it works -->
    <section>
      <div data-content="fr">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight gh-text">Comment ça marche ?</h2>

        <p class="mt-2 max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
          Le principe est volontairement simple. Chacun joue avec les moyens dont il dispose et
          apporte quelque chose au morceau.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight gh-text">How does it work?</h2>

        <p class="mt-2 max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
          The idea is deliberately simple. Everyone plays with whatever they have and brings
          something to the song.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="relative rounded-xl border gh-border p-5">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold gh-text opacity-20">01</span>

          <div data-content="fr">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">Je commence</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              Guitare, basse, batterie ou tout autre instrument. Je crée une première version du
              morceau.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">I start</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              Guitar, bass, drums or any other instrument. I create the first version of the song.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative rounded-xl border gh-border p-5">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold gh-text opacity-20">02</span>

          <div data-content="fr">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">Je partage</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              Les pistes sont disponibles séparément au format WAV pour permettre à chacun de
              travailler dessus.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">I share</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              The individual tracks are shared as WAV files so anyone can work on the song.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative rounded-xl border gh-border p-5">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold gh-text opacity-20">03</span>

          <div data-content="fr">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">Vous ajoutez</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              Une voix, un solo, un clavier, des percussions... votre interprétation rejoint le
              morceau.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">You add</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              Vocals, a solo, keys, percussion... your interpretation becomes part of the song.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative rounded-xl border gh-border p-5">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold gh-text opacity-20">04</span>

          <div data-content="fr">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">On écoute</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              Je mixe les contributions et le morceau évolue au fil des participations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold gh-text">We listen</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
              I mix the contributions and the song evolves with every new musician.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Example collaboration -->
    <section>
      <div data-content="fr">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest gh-text-muted">Exemple</p>

        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight gh-text">
          Un morceau qui évolue au fil des contributions
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-2 max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
          Imaginons un morceau commencé ici, puis enrichi par plusieurs musiciens. Chacun reçoit les
          mêmes pistes de départ et les informations nécessaires pour jouer dans le tempo et la
          tonalité.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest gh-text-muted">Example</p>

        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight gh-text">
          A song that evolves with every contribution
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-2 max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
          Imagine a song started here and gradually enriched by several musicians. Everyone gets the
          same starting tracks and the information needed to play in time and in key.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border gh-border">
        <div class="divide-y gh-border">
          <!-- 01 -->
          <div class="grid gap-4 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] sm:gap-8 sm:p-6">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium gh-text-muted">01</span>

              <div data-content="fr">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">Départ</p>
              </div>

              <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">The beginning</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div data-content="fr">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">Guillaume</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                Guitare, basse et batterie. Le morceau est enregistré et les pistes sont exportées
                depuis <span class="font-mono">00:00:00</span>.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-xs gh-text-muted">120 BPM · 4/4 · Mi mineur (Em)</p>
            </div>

            <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">Guillaume</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                Guitar, bass and drums. The song is recorded and all tracks are exported from
                <span class="font-mono">00:00:00</span>.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-xs gh-text-muted">120 BPM · 4/4 · E minor (Em)</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 02 -->
          <div class="grid gap-4 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] sm:gap-8 sm:p-6">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium gh-text-muted">02</span>

              <div data-content="fr">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">Une voix</p>
              </div>

              <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">A voice</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div data-content="fr">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">Un musicien à l'autre bout du monde</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                Il télécharge les pistes, les importe dans son logiciel audio et ajoute sa voix en
                conservant le même point de départ.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-xs gh-text-muted">Il renvoie uniquement sa nouvelle piste WAV.</p>
            </div>

            <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">A musician on the other side of the world</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                They download the tracks, import them into their audio software and add their voice
                while keeping the same starting point.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-xs gh-text-muted">They send back only their new WAV track.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 03 -->
          <div class="grid gap-4 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] sm:gap-8 sm:p-6">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium gh-text-muted">03</span>

              <div data-content="fr">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">Un autre musicien</p>
              </div>

              <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">Another musician</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div data-content="fr">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">Une nouvelle contribution</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                Quelqu'un d'autre ajoute un clavier, un solo de guitare, un saxophone ou tout autre
                instrument. Il travaille lui aussi à partir des mêmes repères.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-xs gh-text-muted">
                Même tempo · même tonalité · même position de départ
              </p>
            </div>

            <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">A new contribution</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                Someone else adds keyboards, a guitar solo, saxophone or any other instrument. They
                also work from the same musical references.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-xs gh-text-muted">Same tempo · same key · same starting point</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 04 -->
          <div class="grid gap-4 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] sm:gap-8 sm:p-6">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium gh-text-muted">04</span>

              <div data-content="fr">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">Nouvelle version</p>
              </div>

              <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold gh-text">A new version</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div data-content="fr">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">Le morceau prend une nouvelle forme</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                Je récupère les contributions, les mixe avec les pistes originales et publie une
                nouvelle version du morceau.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium gh-text">
                Et une nouvelle contribution peut encore arriver.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
              <p class="font-medium gh-text">The song takes a new shape</p>

              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
                I collect the contributions, mix them with the original tracks and publish a new
                version of the song.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium gh-text">
                And another contribution can still arrive.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-content="fr" class="mt-5 rounded-lg border border-dashed gh-border p-5">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
          <span class="font-medium gh-text">Le principe technique est simple :</span> toutes les pistes
          partent de <span class="font-mono gh-text">00:00:00</span>. Le tempo, la mesure, la
          tonalité et les autres informations musicales accompagnent les fichiers pour que chaque
          musicien puisse enregistrer sa partie directement dans le bon cadre.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-content="en" class="hidden mt-5 rounded-lg border border-dashed gh-border p-5">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
          <span class="font-medium gh-text">The technical principle is simple:</span> every track starts
          at <span class="font-mono gh-text">00:00:00</span>. Tempo, time signature, key and other
          musical information are provided with the files so every musician can record their part
          within the same framework.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Open invitation -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border gh-border p-8 sm:p-10">
      <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 blur-3xl">
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div data-content="fr">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest gh-text-muted">Et maintenant ?</p>

          <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-none text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight gh-text">
            Le premier morceau est en préparation.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 max-w-none leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
            Je travaille actuellement sur le premier morceau de ce projet. Lorsqu'il sera prêt, les
            pistes seront disponibles ici et chacun pourra tenter d'y ajouter sa propre partie.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-medium gh-text">
            Peut-être que le prochain son viendra de l'autre bout du monde.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest gh-text-muted">What's next?</p>

          <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-none text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight gh-text">
            The first song is being prepared.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 max-w-none leading-relaxed gh-text-muted">
            I'm currently working on the first song for this project. Once it's ready, the
            individual tracks will be available here and anyone will be able to add their own part.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-medium gh-text">
            Maybe the next sound will come from the other side of the world.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer statement -->
    <section class="pb-4 text-center">
      <div data-content="fr">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium gh-text">Jouer. Partager. Construire ensemble.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-content="en" class="hidden">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium gh-text">Play. Share. Build together.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".lang-button");
    const contents = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-content]");

    buttons.forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const language = button.dataset.lang;

        if (!language) return;

        buttons.forEach((item) => {
          const active = item.dataset.lang === language;

          item.classList.toggle("gh-text", active);
          item.classList.toggle("gh-text-muted", !active);
          item.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(active));
        });

        contents.forEach((content) => {
          content.classList.toggle("hidden", content.dataset.content !== language);
        });
      });
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
